The r_1 and the r_2 and the r_10 and the r_24 and the r_11 and the r_39 and the r_12 and the r_40 and the r_13 and the r_15 and the r_16 and the r_23 and the r_9 and the r_25 and the r_28 and the r_0 and the r_3 and the r_17 and the r_31 and the r_34 and the r_6 and the r_35 and the r_7 and the r_38 and the r_4 and the r_18 and the r_5 and the r_8 and the r_22 and the r_37 and the r_14 and the r_19 and the r_20 and the r_21 and the r_26 and the r_27 and the r_29 and the r_30 and the r_32 and the r_33 and the r_36 and the r_41 are privately-named.

